[0m[0m
Same shape in [38;5;10mtotal[0m and [38;5;10msmoothen[0m. Since x86 returns the [3mdestination[23m NaN quieted when both operands are NaN, and [38;5;10mmatch[0m reinterprets its [38;5;10mdouble[0m scratch buffers as [38;5;10mfloat[0m lanes, these payload choices are genuinely observable. Corrected all three.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mAliasing UB.[22m [38;5;10mspectral_contrast[0m built two [38;5;10m&mut [f32][0m from its two raw pointers, but [38;5;10minclude/match.h[0m has no [38;5;10mrestrict[0m, so [38;5;10mspectral_contrast(a, a, n)[0m is a legal call that normalises one buffer twice. Two overlapping [38;5;10m&mut[0m is instant Rust UB and LLVM's [38;5;10mnoalias[0m could reorder the [38;5;10mnormalize[0m passes. Rewrote [38;5;10mdot_product[0m/[38;5;10mnormalize[0m/[38;5;10mspectral_contrast[0m on raw pointers.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The translation's central insight was already right and I kept it: [38;5;10mspectral_contrast.c[0m never includes [38;5;10mmatch.h[0m, so its [38;5;10mfloat_t[0m comes from [38;5;10m<math.h>[0m and is [38;5;10mfloat[0m (confirmed: [38;5;10mFLT_EVAL_METHOD=0[0m, [38;5;10msizeof(float_t)=4[0m, 4-byte stride in the object). [38;5;10mmatch[0m hands it [38;5;10mdouble[0m buffers, which it walks as [38;5;10mfloat[0m.[0m[0m
